[[File:Woklings_btm.jpg|thumb|right|250px|A group of woklings]]
'''Woklings''' were infant [[Ewok]]s. They typically slept in baskets. When they grew older, each received a hood to wear and became a full member of [[Gender|their]] tribe.<ref name="AB Update">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know, Updated and Expanded]]''</ref>

